{"wrong_question_id":"wq_252b218cdf0b47f49b14","question_id":"q_40b98ab67b7c4f52a39e","question_number":"17","question_type":"single_choice","question_content":"已知函数 f(x) = x^3 - 3x^2 + 2，求 f(x) 的单调递增区间。","choices":{"A":"(-inf, 0)","B":"(0, 2)","C":"(-inf, 0) and (2, +inf)","D":"(2, +inf)"},"student_answer":"A","correct_answer":"C","explanation":"f'(x) = 3x^2 - 6x = 3x(x-2)，令 f'(x) > 0 得 x<0 或 x>2，故单调递增区间为 (-inf,0) 和 (2,+inf)。","correctness":"wrong","knowledge_point_id":"math.derivative.monotonicity","knowledge_point_name":"利用导数判断函数单调性与单调区间","error_type":"transformation","error_label":"函数性质转换错误","diagnosis":"学生能够正确求出导数，但把导数符号与函数单调性的对应关系弄反了。","image_url":"http://121.43.137.176:17283/media/ana_55db89f4f7eb448e8353/0.png","source_type":"homework","source_id":"hw_46aef1224cb74b1aad9f","source_name":"数学月考·第17题","status":"open","favorite":false,"created_at":"2026-10-02T15:15:32.679689Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T15:15:32.679689Z","can_start_tutor":true}